\f0\fs24 \cf0 # WealthLens\
\
## Vision\
\
WealthLens is an AI-powered financial copilot that helps users predict financial problems before they happen.\
\
## Target Users\
\
- College students\
- Young professionals\
- First-time budgeters\
\
## Core Features\
\
### MVP\
\
- Authentication\
- Plaid Integration\
- Transaction Dashboard\
- AI Insights\
- Subscription Detection\
- Financial Health Score\
\
## Tech Stack\
\
Frontend:\
- Next.js\
- React\
- TypeScript\
- Tailwind\
\
Backend:\
- Node.js\
- PostgreSQL\
- Prisma\
\
AI:\
- FastAPI\
- OpenAI/Gemini\
- Pandas\
\
## Coding Standards\
\
- TypeScript strict mode\
- Reusable components\
- Server actions where appropriate\
- No duplicated business logic\
- Mobile responsive\
\
## Folder Structure\
\
/app\
/components\
/lib\
/server\
/prisma\
/ai-service\
\
## UI Guidelines\
\
- Modern fintech design\
- Similar to Mercury and Stripe\
- Dark mode first\
- Responsive\
\
## Future Features\
\
- Investment tracking\
- Credit score monitoring\
- Spending predictions\
- Financial goals}